    [Misc] main2main 1023  (#19694)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Port `vllm-ascend` to vLLM main `544f182d` (bumped from `c0b6f74`) while
    keeping the
    `v0.31.0` release lane green. The upstream window drops
    `replace_parameter(..., prefer_copy=...)`,
    fuses the Kimi-K3 output gate into the QKV-A projection, adds the ROCm
    Kimi-K3
    specialized-decode hooks, widens the EPLB expert-weight and
    rejection-sample contracts, and
    adds the DP-drafter `num_reqs_override`, the MRv2 `skip_sample` drafting
    skip, the HiSparse
    `topk_buffer_width`, the SimpleCPUOffload CPU-block RPC and the abstract
    `AsyncModelRunnerOutput.get_kv_connector_output`. Every gate below is
    either a
    `vllm_version_is("0.31.0")` split or an attribute/signature probe.
    
    | Files | Upstream vLLM change (why it breaks vllm-ascend) | vllm-ascend
    adaptation |
    
